  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. <br>• Pick and finely chop rosemary. <br>• Cut potato into fries and place on the lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and sprinkle over garlic &amp; herb spice blend and rosemary. <br>• Toss to coat, spread out evenly and bake until tender, 20-25 mins. <br>• Meanwhile, slice haloumi into 1cm thick slices. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69648337e6255ccadc13b43f/step-7b145100.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Thinly slice onion and tomato. Drain haloumi and pat dry.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69648337e6255ccadc13b43f/step-68579d10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. <br>• Cook onion until softened and starting to brown, 5-6 mins. Transfer to a small bowl. <br>• Return pan to medium heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook haloumi until golden, 1-2 mins each side. Remove pan from heat and add the honey, turning haloumi to coat. Season with pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69648337e6255ccadc13b43f/step-78847b20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Bake continental rolls directly on oven rack until heated through, 2-3 mins. <br>• Halve rolls and spread with mustard mayo. Top with salad leaves, tomato, haloumi and onion. <br>• Serve with garlic potato fries and your favourite dipping sauce.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69648337e6255ccadc13b43f/step-fdeba730.jpg"
    }
  ]
